span.p:
Independent deadline guardian
Cancel blocked work and owned child groups;
660 seconds remains diagnostic and unqualified

EDIT comparison from the prior seal
Every prior duty needs a disposition;
preserved duties keep their component and workstream owners

Normalized source-duty ledger
Product identity, performers, actions and targets;
declared workflow and recurring duties stay distinct

Source identity and performer custody preflight
Resolve the product identity separately from actors;
retain exact performer quotes in normalized statements

Source-only verifier and canonical ledger
Prove product identity, performers, workflow roles and every prior EDIT duty;
typed carriers and correction authorization retain custody

Optional private diagnostic retention
Exact inputs and returned streams before refusal or cleanup;
same deadline and stable private parent;
no admission authority

One candidate authoring pass
Propose architecture and lifecycle allocations;
the source ledger owns product identity, performers and event IDs

Deterministic candidate admission
Build one complete graph from verified duties;
a verified whole-product action does not create a subsystem

Three views of the same source graph
Declared workflow follows verified source membership;
first run adds only cited discrete prerequisites;
recurring safeguards retain guards and proof outside that run

Shared phase budgets
300-second gate and candidate window, 15-second completion reserve;
source inventory and verifier use separate caps;
every phase consumes the same whole deadline

Bounded-route pending seal
Quarantine holds a completion digest;
stored state alone cannot permit confirmation

Complete the owned journey
Retain, clean, finish observer and completion-record I/O;
certify only within the final whole and proposal deadlines

Deliver the completion receipt
Private nonce issued only after certification;
receipt delivery follows measured preparation

Expired or interrupted journey
Keep new seals unconfirmable;
preserve old EDIT seals and recovery journals

Explicit terminal CONFIRM
Verify delivered receipt and exact sealed hash;
no model, parser, generation, or repair

Detached independent semantic and UX evaluator
Checks frozen source predicates and forward/reverse coverage;
reads immutable outputs without changing consumer transactions
